---
/**
 * The AI screen's services, side by side (documentation/editor/ai-services.md §8): the page puts a card per
 * service in it, then Add a service. The region the screen redraws after a change.
 * @tier editor
 * @a11y A layout only: it adds no role, so each card and the form keep their own headings, in the source's order.
 */
import PanelGrid from '../kit/PanelGrid.astro';
---

<PanelGrid data-region="ai-services" data-ai-services=""><slot /></PanelGrid>
